, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 376.4, "m": [331.7, 360.8, 340.6, 372.6]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 298.5, "y0": 376.4, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 395.1, "m": [331.7, 379.4, 340.6, 391.2]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 298.5, "y0": 395.1, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 415.3, "m": [331.7, 398.1, 340.6, 409.9]}], "answer": [3]}, {"no": 20, "regions": [{"page": 1, "x0": 298.5, "y0": 433.7, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 704.2}], "text": "문20. Nien의생성평형상수()가NiNH의생성평\n형상수()보다배만큼더크다. 이차이를설명할수있는가\n장적절한효과는? (단, en ethylenediamine)\nNien⇌Nien\n\nNien\nNien\nNiNH⇌NiNH\n\nNiNH\nNiNH\n①결정장효과(crystal field effect)\n②킬레이트효과(chelate effect)\n③얀텔러효과(Jahn-Teller effect)\n④틴들효과(Tyndall effect)", "choices": [{"r": 0, "x0": 298.5, "y0": 628.3, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 646.9, "m": [331.7, 631.3, 340.6, 643.1]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 298.5, "y0": 646.9, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 665.5, "m": [331.7, 649.9, 340.6, 661.7]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 298.5, "y0": 665.5, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 684.1, "m": [331.7, 668.5, 340.6, 680.3]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 298.5, "y0": 684.1, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 704.2, "m": [331.7, 687.1, 340.6, 698.9]}], "answer": [2]}]}